<div id="contact" class="contact">
    <h1 class="contact-title">Get in touch with us!</h1>
    <p class="get-in-touch">
        Whether you’re curious about job openings, have a great idea for a partnership, or just want to drop us a line – Please get in touch with us via the form below. We look forward to hearing from you!
    </p>
    <form class="contact-form">
        <input type="text" class="contact-control" placeholder="Your email address" />
        <input type="text" class="contact-control" placeholder="Subject" />
        <textarea class="contact-control message" placeholder="Message"></textarea>
        <button class="btn-send">send message</button>
    </form>
</div>
